{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 You will complete three findings using the data set provided by the Skills Win Coaching Organization.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b Finding 1 | Basic graphing.} Create a graph following the PST 315 graphing guidelines that answers the following question: did students find the coaches helpful, not helpful, or did they feel neutral?\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b Finding 2 | Aggregate graph.} Create a graph following the PST 315 graphing guidelines that answers the following question: how strongly did students from each site agree that the exercises were engaging?\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b Finding 3 | Open-ended question, single category.} Create a graph following the PST 315 graphing guidelines that answers the following question: what did students feel could be improved at their site sessions?\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li720 \fi0 {\b Tip}\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li720 \fi0 Every aggregate graph should be accompanied by disaggregated graphs in Appendix V. Open-ended responses should be listed in Appendix IV.\par}
